    "review": {
      "info": "Storage owner is acquired before any consensus inspection and remains in run_info through output. Consensus helper requires borrowed owner. Existing-snapshot open with no checkpoint does not save.",
      "signal": "The I/O Result is retained by select and StopTrigger. Whole-shutdown hook runs before failure reporting; first error persists through engine grace. Normal success receives identical notification and cleanup.",
